# Inventaario / Invis — local env template
# Copy to `.env` or `.env.local` (gitignored). Never commit real keys.
#
# Live product photo analysis (Gemini).
EXPO_PUBLIC_GEMINI_API_KEY=
# Preferred for production: GEMINI_API_KEY on the server (/api/vision).
#
# Restart Expo after changing env (`npx expo start`).
#
# Supabase Auth — email OTP waitlist + user registry (optional for demos).
# If both are empty, the app skips auth (Vercel demo / offline preview works).
# Project: Invis — https://supabase.com/dashboard/project/bpazrlmozjrxnrkfrvrq
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://YOUR_PROJECT.supabase.co
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-or-publishable-key
# Dashboard setup (once):
# 1. Authentication → Providers → Email enabled
# 2. Authentication → Email Templates → Magic Link: include {{ .Token }}
#    so the message shows a 6-digit OTP (not only a link)
# 3. Authentication → URL Configuration → Site URL = your web origin
# 4. Activate a waitlisted user: Table Editor → profiles → status = active
#    (waitlist.status syncs to approved automatically)
# Also set EXPO_PUBLIC_* on Vercel (Production + Preview) and redeploy.
# Never commit the service_role key.
